    "explanationHtml": "<p><span class=\"font-s20\">$y=ax~(a\\not=0)$로 놓고 $x=6,~y=-2$를 대입하면</span></p><p><span class=\"font-s20\">$-2=6a$<span class=\"hml-align-space\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.5em;white-space:pre\">   </span>$\\therefore \\hspace{0.25em} a=- \\dfrac{1}{3}$</span></p><p><span class=\"font-s20\">$\\therefore \\hspace{0.25em} y=- \\dfrac{1}{3} x$</span></p><p><span class=\"font-s20\">③ $y=- \\dfrac{1}{3} x$에 $x=1,~y=-3$을 대입하면</span></p><p><span class=\"hml-align-space\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:1.5em;white-space:pre\">   </span><span class=\"font-s20\">$-3\\not=- \\dfrac{1}{3} \\times 1$</span></p>",
